  Instructions:
  - Watch the astronaut.
  - Get ready to copy the pose and hold your body still
  - This icon will show how well you are keeping your balance. Try to keep it level,
    and in the centre.
  - See what happens when you move or lean.
  - You will see a countdown from 3 and then you will need to hold the pose as still
    as you can.
  - Keep going until the timer ends.
  - If the astronaut's visor is grey, it means your eyes should be closed. Listen
    out for when the timer ends!
  InstructionText: {fileID: 117462222}
  endTutorial:
    m_PersistentCalls:
